OL,3,GNEWSAThe St Helens man who
OL,4,Arevolutionised Hollywood sound
OL,5,
OL,6,FPioneering Hollywood sound engineer
OL,7,FGeorge Groves, dubbed 'the quiet little
OL,8,FEnglishman" by 1920s star Al Jonson,
OL,9,Fhas been honoured with a blue plaque in
OL,10,Fthe Merseyside town of his birth.
OL,12,FBorn and raised in St Helens, the
OL,13,Fmusician's definitive work in sound
OL,14,Frecording led him to collaborate with
OL,15,Fstars such as Judy Garland, James
OL,16,FCagney and Frank Sinatra, and won him a
OL,17,Fpair of Oscars.
OL,19,FEntertainment historian Mervyn
OL,20,FSaunders, also from St Helens, called
OL,21,Fhim "such a clever man".
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,406,400,260,160,0,100
