OL,3,GNEWSAThe St Helens man who
OL,4,Arevolutionised Hollywood sound
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis week, Groves, who was the leading
OL,7,Frecording engineer for Jonson in 1927's
OL,8,FThe Jazz Singer - one of the first
OL,9,F'talkie' feature films, was
OL,10,Fcommemorated 125 years after his birth
OL,11,Fwith a plaque inside the Theatre Royal.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
